  "content_id": "16136248",
  "title": "Dash (DASH) Network Fees",
  "description": "Dash (DASH) Network  – Instant and Cheap\nDash is designed for speed and low fees, with features like InstantSend for nearly-instant paymen...",
  "body": "<hr><h1 id=\"h_01JSYYGK6X2XRPDMNRHV4MERC2\">Dash (DASH) Network – Instant and Cheap</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Dash is designed for <b>speed and low fees</b>, with features like InstantSend for nearly-instant payments.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSYYGK6XB0Z95E0PCG8ZJSRE\">How Dash Fees Work</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Dash uses the UTXO model like Bitcoin, so fees depend on:</p><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Transaction size in bytes</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Current network congestion</b></p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Edge queries Dash nodes to recommend the best fee for your transaction.</p><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>InstantSend transactions</b> may cost slightly more but confirm almost instantly.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYYGK6XSQG9BQSKVV10JQRS\">Fee Options You Can Choose</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Fastest confirmation, great if you're using InstantSend</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Balanced speed and cost</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheapest fee, slower confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Full control for advanced users</p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">To adjust: Start a send → Tap <b>fee settings gear</b> → Pick your preset or set a custom fee.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYYGK6XGT75GATA3Y60GHQR\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">A standard Dash transaction costs around <b>$0.002 to $0.005 USD</b>.<br>Even InstantSend is extremely affordable.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSYYGK6X8TJQX816M9K6FWC5\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Dash offers blazing-fast and private transactions. Edge Wallet keeps it simple, automatically suggesting the best fees for speed or savings based on your needs.</p><hr>",
